<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of games played in the Spanish first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Atletico Madrid 2 (Jose Luis Caminero 48th, Santi Denia 60th) Espanyol 1 (Javi Garcia 35th). Halftime 0-0. Attendance 24,000.</p>
<p>Compostela 0 Deportivo Coruna 0. 9,000.</p>
<p>Tenerife 3 (Antonio Robaina 55th, Juanele Castanos 87th, Meho Kodro 90th) Hercules 1 (Manuel Alfaro, pen 85th). 0-0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Valencia 0 Extremadura 0. 19,000.</p>
